{
  "slug": "adaptive-agent",
  "name": "Adaptive Agent",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Make your AI agent get stronger with use. Includes two skills: /skill-review (periodic audit of all skills for staleness, missing gotchas, and improvements) and /build-user-profile (build user profile from workspace context so the agent knows who you are). Also includes CLAUDE.md behavioral rules for skill self-improvement on friction, memory-to-skill feedback loops, and automatic skill gap detection. Inspired by Hermes Agent's four-layer memory architecture.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `build-user-profile` (Build or update the user profile memory by observing workspace context, git history, and conversation patterns), `skill-review` (Review all skills for staleness, missing gotchas, and improvement opportunities).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install adaptive-agent@claude-community` from `truenorth-lj/adaptive-agent-skill`.",
